            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"verdict\">\u9700\u8981\u4f60\u56de\u7684 verdict</h2>\n<div class=\"language-text codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>Prompt mode 30-pair:\n\n- singing prompt \u662f\u5426\u7ecf\u5e38\u66f4\u50cf target identity: yes / no / mixed\n\n- \u5982\u679c mixed\uff0c\u54ea\u4e9b pair speech prompt wins:\n\n- \u4e3b\u8981\u53d8\u5316\u66f4\u50cf identity / breathy-phonation / singing-domain / loudness-quality:\n\n- artifact-heavy pair numbers:\n\nComponent ablation 12-pair:\n\n- mel_style \u662f\u5426\u63a5\u8fd1 oracle_all_singing: yes / no / mixed\n\n- \u5355\u5206\u91cf\u6700\u660e\u663e: mel / style / prompt_seq / none\n\n- style \u7684\u6548\u679c\u66f4\u50cf identity / timbre / technique-phonation / loudness-quality:\n\n- prompt_seq_only \u662f\u5426\u57fa\u672c\u65e0\u6548: yes / no / mixed\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">\u8fd9\u4e2a verdict \u51b3\u5b9a\u4e0b\u4e00\u6b65\uff1a</span>\n<ul>\n<li>\u5982\u679c\u662f identity\uff1a\u7ee7\u7eed SeedVC \u5185\u90e8 mel/style \u6216 CAMPPlus style mapping\u3002</li>\n<li>\u5982\u679c\u662f domain/phonation\uff1aTrack 1 \u4f5c\u4e3a prompt mismatch accounting \u4fdd\u7559\uff0cSeedVC link \u6539\u5199\u6210 domain/phonation mechanism\u3002</li>\n<li>\u5982\u679c artifact/loudness \u4e3b\u5bfc\uff1arerun \u9ad8 diffusion steps / \u66f4\u4e25 loudness QA / \u66f4\u5747\u8861 pairs\u3002</li>\n</ul></span>"
